# Block stray root-level JSON. Failed spec downloads have written 14-byte
# "404 Not Found" bodies to the repo root before (cloudflare.json, etc.).
# Legitimate JSON lives under assets/, fixtures/, examples/, docs-site/,
# or vscode-extension/ — never loose in the root. (action.yml is YAML and
# stays tracked.)
